@page "/"

<PageTitle>Quad Damage</PageTitle>

<h3>Welcome to the Quad? Randomizer Beta</h3>
<div class="container">
    
    <h4>Quick helpful notes</h4>
    <ul>
        <li>The portal to Zelda 1 is the Kakariko Fortune Teller</li>
        <li>The portal to Metroid 1 is the Lumberjack hut</li>
        <li>More portals will be added later</li>
        <li>For the "Ganon" goal, all final bosses are required to be defeated to beat the game</li>
        <li>For the "TriforceHunt" goal, find 66 out 100 pieces and turn it in near hyrule castle</li>
        <li>The SM logic is similar, but not the same, as SMZ3 normal logic where IBJ can be required. No hellruns are required.</li>
   </ul>

   <br />
   <h4>Some known issues</h4>
   <ul>
       <li>The portal from Metroid 1 is janky and you might need to go back and forth to make it work inside Metroid 1</li>
       <li>Some palette issues and color issues with items</li>
       <li>The starting menu doesn't do anything useful right now since the game always starts in SM</li>
       <li>The placement logic isn't fully completed so some locations might not be properly randomized</li>
    </ul>

   <br />
   <h4>Upcoming features in some future build</h4>
    <ul>
        <li>More goals, such as setting the amount of crystals/triforces/bosses to be killed to unlock the final bosses</li>
        <li>More cross-game portals to enable easier cross-game travel</li>
        <li>More game modes such as keysanity and so on</li>
        <li>Ability to select the specific games to play instead of always playing all four</li>
    </ul>


</div>

